  <item>
    <title>VOL 19.关于过年，我们有点想聊的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6989432ea22480add637c1f4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6989432ea22480add637c1f4</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Feb 2026 02:21:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>新年就要到了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有些人开始期待，也有些人慢慢犹豫；有人踏上回家的路，有人选择留在原地，或远走他乡；</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期，我们聊年味、聊变化、聊习惯、聊选择，也聊那些过年时被反复问起的人生问题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>论你此刻在哪里，希望这段声音，能陪你安安静静地走完这段路。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝收听愉快。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「本期主播」 大福｜Like｜寻仔</span></p><span></span><p><span>「内容提要」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="173">02:53</a> &nbsp;年味，烟花与集体记忆的消散；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="555">09:15</a> &nbsp;我们为什么还在期待过年；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1146">19:06</a> &nbsp;家族之间的亲情链接，算不算一种情感社交；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1625">27:05</a> &nbsp;同辈之间话题错位与沟通的断层感；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">30:05</a> &nbsp;过年需要属地化吗；</span></p><span></span><p><span>「本期歌单」</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢快中国风 - NA</span></p><span></span><p><span>「收听方式」</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙 ｜ 网易云音乐 ｜ Apple Podcast</span></p><span></span><p><span>「联系我们」</span></p><span></span><p><span>sensible_animal@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎来信投稿，一起吐槽，一起分享，一起发疯，一起治愈。</span></p>]]></description>
