  <item>
    <title>VOL 16.三十岁，才是人生的开场</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/689964bf20a2906a4dea2199</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">689964bf20a2906a4dea2199</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 11 Aug 2025 03:39:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>二十岁，笃定人生刚刚开始，仿佛有着无限的可能；二十五岁，与闺蜜通话倾诉焦虑，感叹人生的可能性似乎在一点点减少，从眼前的“条条大路”，到只剩几条窄窄的小径；步入三十，回望这段路，削减的并不是可能性，而是混乱与迷惘。路，越走越清，好似这才是属于真正长大的安心与笃定。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝收听愉快。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「本期主播」 大福｜Like｜寻仔</span></p><span></span><p><span>「内容提要」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">01:44</a> &nbsp;长大了，真不错</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> &nbsp;对三字头的幻想与误区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a> &nbsp;情绪感知力的变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> &nbsp;安全感的来源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> &nbsp;二字头十年做对的三件事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">1:00:00</a> &nbsp;对35岁的期待</span></p><span></span><p><span>「本期歌单」</span></p><span></span><p><span>NA</span></p><span></span><p><span>「收听方式」</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙 ｜ 网易云音乐 ｜ Apple Podcast&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>「联系我们」</span></p><span></span><p><span>sensible_animal@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎来信投稿，一起吐槽，一起分享，一起发疯，一起治愈。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6698a4ade4cb850e2eb6884f/li_SdBjHNu0x9CXYor8jnsjbWjwb.m4a" length="66688718" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:08:43</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft1dFXfBCVhHscDUkTk5wKrnRw88.png"/>
