  <item>
    <title>VOL 14.搭子文化，当代人为何需要“细分社交”？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68218cc624f855934625faae</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68218cc624f855934625faae</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 May 2025 06:05:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>吃饭搭子、旅游搭子、逛街搭子、emo搭子……你是否也有一群“限定场合限定陪伴”的朋友？这期我们聊聊“搭子文化”，这个听起来轻松甚至有点敷衍的词背后，其实藏着现代人对关系的选择与界限。相比于之前固定的朋友类型，我们现在开始追求“分工明确”的陪伴？在关系变得越来越轻量化的当下，“搭子”是否比“朋友”更符合我们的生活节奏？</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝收听愉快。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「本期主播」 大福｜Like｜寻仔｜贞贞</span></p><span></span><p><span>「内容提要」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:58</a> &nbsp;为什么社交搭子成为主流；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="479">07:59</a> &nbsp;如果朋友被分解成不同的搭子，亲密关系会消失吗；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="651">10:51</a> &nbsp;搭子关系需要经营吗；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1073">17:53</a> &nbsp;搭子倾诉能量的平衡；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1355">22:35</a> &nbsp;搭子类型分享；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1671">27:51</a> &nbsp;恋爱搭子，是新型关系还是逃避责任；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2159">35:59</a> &nbsp;婚姻关系转变带来的情感变化；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2635">43:55</a> &nbsp;“浅社交”长期下来，可能更难投入真正的亲密关系；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2934">48:54</a> &nbsp;更享受一个人做事情，还是和搭子一起；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3282">54:42</a> &nbsp;孤独等级表自检；</span></p><span></span><p><span>「本期歌单」</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lovers´ carvings - Bibio</span></p><span></span><p><span>Banana Pancakes - Jake Johnson</span></p><span></span><p><span>「收听方式」</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙 ｜ 网易云音乐 ｜ Apple Podcast</span></p><span></span><p><span>「联系我们」</span></p><span></span><p><span>sensible_animal@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎来信投稿，一起吐槽，一起分享，一起发疯，一起治愈。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6698a4ade4cb850e2eb6884f/ljB2BcERIxNR9TDAAnqecUzYwltw.m4a" length="70146383" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:17</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft1dFXfBCVhHscDUkTk5wKrnRw88.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>VOL 13.修仙职场：靠风水保命，靠摸鱼续命</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6818486347ebeede7ece0d8a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6818486347ebeede7ece0d8a</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 05 May 2025 05:53:09 +0000</pubDate>
