  <item>
    <title>VOL 7.海岛古巴，肉身之苦的理想国与浮生录</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674a9228c3b2a2f3348b84a7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674a9228c3b2a2f3348b84a7</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 30 Nov 2024 04:40:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>为什么是古巴？他热情，浪漫；他破旧，沧桑；他自由，闭塞；他是停滞的时代，是记忆的留存，更是一个仿佛被遗忘的国度。我们三个在不同的时期分别都曾来过这里，曾经的拉美岁月得到片刻的重合，Malecon日落的流金时刻并不足以掩盖困在过去的时光，切格瓦拉的自由精神也随着时代而没落，在拉美旅居的心情和境遇，与其说是看世界，不如说是看自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝收听愉快。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「本期主播」大福 ｜ Like ｜ 寻仔</span></p><span></span><p><span>「内容提要」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a> &nbsp;古巴初印象，离职前在拉美最后的旅行；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="374">06:14</a> &nbsp;古巴影片爱恨情仇的历史缩影；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1216">20:16</a> &nbsp;离职后说走就走，一路被坑，一路潇洒；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1612">26:52</a> &nbsp;晚上在古巴的大街上骑着摩托压马路；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1989">33:09</a> &nbsp;本地向导，一个古巴的中国留学生；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2873">47:53</a> &nbsp;古巴奇葩的打车经历，群里手动抢单；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2964">49:24</a> &nbsp;古巴酒吧奇遇记；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3688">01:01:28</a> &nbsp;仗剑走天涯的骑马体验；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4042">01:07:22</a> &nbsp;临时旅行搭子喝酒事故；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4288">01:11:28</a> &nbsp;饭后散步古巴人民真实的生活景象；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4564">01:16:04</a> &nbsp;开眼界这件事对个人的影响；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4926">01:22:06</a> &nbsp;番外：库曼斯坦的社会主义；</span></p><span></span><p><span>「本期歌单」</span></p><span></span><p><span>Chan Chan - &nbsp;Havana Jazz Band</span></p><span></span><p><span>「收听方式」</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙 ｜ 网易云音乐 ｜ Apple Podcast</span></p><span></span><p><span>「联系我们」</span></p><span></span><p><span>sensible_animal@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎来信投稿，一起吐槽，一起分享，一起发疯，一起治愈。</span></p>]]></description>
