    <title>VOL 5.拉美旅行见闻实录</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6719ea930d2f24f2897c8f02</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6719ea930d2f24f2897c8f02</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 24 Oct 2024 06:34:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>拉美生活多年，走走停停看看，各种旅行经历在成为生命体验一部分的同时，见证了我们怎么样的人生成长呢？见世界，见自己，生命旅程永远在路上，少年没有乌托邦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝收听愉快。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「本期主播」大福 ｜ Like</span></p><span></span><p><span>「内容提要」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a> &nbsp;大福旅行地集锦回忆；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="354">05:54</a> &nbsp;大福和Like智利🇨🇱时空交集重叠；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="738">12:18</a> &nbsp;大福Top 3推荐地（好难选）；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="887">14:47</a> &nbsp;大福理想居住地选择；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> &nbsp;巴西🇧🇷印象；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1277">21:17</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;Like拉美旅行记忆点；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1371">22:51</a> &nbsp;墨西哥🇲🇽亡灵节旅行地推荐；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1445">24:05</a> &nbsp;厄瓜多尔🇪🇨龟岛初体验；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1685">28:05</a> &nbsp;墨西哥🇲🇽森林野营绝佳体验感；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">31:50</a> &nbsp;旅行糟心体验（古巴🇨🇺海关&amp;多米酒店check in）；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2164">36:04</a> &nbsp;古巴🇨🇺社会主义与发展；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2614">43:34</a> &nbsp;秘鲁🇵🇪印加文化的传承；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2759">45:59</a> &nbsp;旅行搭子的选择；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2908">48:28</a> &nbsp;拉美大巴旅行分享；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3068">51:08</a> &nbsp;拉美旅行与成长经历的互相影响；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3351">55:51</a> &nbsp;旅行的契机和地点的选择；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3586">59:46</a> &nbsp;未来旅行计划&amp;过往旅行总结；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3586">59:46</a> &nbsp;番外之Like拉美各国喝酒晕倒系列故事；</span></p><span></span><p><span>「本期歌单」</span></p><span></span><p><span>NA</span></p><span></span><p><span>「收听方式」</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙 ｜ 网易云音乐 ｜ Apple Podcast</span></p><span></span><p><span>「联系我们」</span></p><span></span><p><span>sensible_animal@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎来信投稿，一起吐槽，一起分享，一起发疯，一起治愈。</span></p>]]></description>
